<title>USA: Most IMM currency futures rally late, end higher.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currency futures rally late, end higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 14 - Most IMM currency futures rallied late and ended higher. June yen hit buystops in fast market trade to end at highest price since late Jan. Traders said fund buying was aggressive on the yen run-up. Marks and Swiss popped into positive territory late and sterling ended up strongly.</p>
